	(text "PA14 = SWCLK / BOOT0. BOOT button pulls it to 3V3; 10k pull-down keeps SWD usable.\nDFU: hold BOOT, press RESET. An empty flash boots into the ROM bootloader anyway.\nCheck option byte nBOOT_SEL on the first board if the button has no effect (F8).\nUnused GPIO: no-connect (41 spare, docs/pinout-dockboard.md)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
